{"seq":1,"slug":"the-1948-paper","title":"一九四八年论文","docCount":2,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/claude-shannon/major-works/the-1948-paper","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"a-mathematical-theory-of-communication","title":"《通信的数学理论》其文","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/claude-shannon/major-works/the-1948-paper/a-mathematical-theory-of-communication","wordCount":1816,"readingTime":8},{"seq":2,"slug":"a-landmark-paper","title":"一篇里程碑式的论文","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/claude-shannon/major-works/the-1948-paper/a-landmark-paper","wordCount":1534,"readingTime":7}],"introMarkdown":"# 一九四八年论文\n\n本章呈现香农的一九四八年论文《通信的数学理论》。这篇划时代的论文，几乎独力地创立了信息论，被誉为\"信息时代的大宪章\",是科学史上一篇里程碑式的论文。两篇文档，分别呈现《通信的数学理论》其文，以及一篇里程碑式的论文。\n"}